# Supabase Backend Configuration (Optional / Live Deployment)
# When provided, the app connects directly to your live Supabase instance with Realtime and PostgreSQL.
# If omitted or during local demo, the app operates automatically with built-in high-resilience local realtime store.

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key
